  "content_text_body": "The Joint Commission has several standards and resources available to improve the accuracy of patient identification.\n\n### Why is it important?\n\nThroughout the healthcare industry the failure to correctly identify patients continues to lead to major patient safety events. Patient errors can occur in virtually all stages of diagnosis and treatment.  \n\n**Listen to the podcast below and note key themes and takeaways to drive positive change and improvement within the organization**\n\nPodcast:  [Speak Up - Preventing Medical Errors](https://www.jointcommission.org/resources/news-and-multimedia/podcasts/take-5-right-id/)\n\n>Sources: \n\n>The Joint Commission",
